{"branch":"이곡점","html":"<section id=\"selected-directions\" class=\"km-directions\" aria-labelledby=\"selected-directions-title\" data-km-branch=\"이곡점\"><h3 id=\"selected-directions-title\">찾아오시는 길</h3><p class=\"km-intro\">이곡점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"km-map\" data-state=\"waiting\"><iframe data-km-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/maps/39tzh228wph.htm\" title=\"이곡점 카카오 지도\" width=\"800\" height=\"398\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe><p class=\"km-map-status\">카카오 지도</p></div><div class=\"km-details\"><dl><dt>주소</dt><dd>대구광역시 달서구 이곡동 달구벌대로259길 33 제일빌딩 5층</dd></dl><section class=\"km-transit\"><h4>주변 지하철</h4><ul><li><span class=\"km-line\">대구 2호선</span>성서산업단지역</li><li><span class=\"km-line\">대구 2호선</span>이곡역</li></ul></section><section class=\"km-transit\"><h4>주변 정류장</h4><ul><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">1</span>국민연금네거리</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">2</span>동서화성타운앞</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">3</span>국민연금네거리1</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">4</span>동서화성타운건너</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">5</span>국민연금네거리2</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">6</span>성서우체국앞</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">7</span>성서우체국건너</li></ul></section><section class=\"km-transit\"><h4>주변 버스</h4><ul class=\"km-buses\"><li><span class=\"km-bus-kind\" data-type=\"0101\">간선</span><span class=\"km-route-names\"><span>405</span><span>503</span><span>504</span><span>527(연화리-동명교통)</span><span>523</span><span>564</span></span></li><li><span class=\"km-bus-kind\" data-type=\"0102\">지선</span><span class=\"km-route-names\"><span>달서3</span><span>달서5</span></span></li><li><span class=\"km-bus-kind\" data-type=\"0108\">급행간선</span><span class=\"km-route-names\"><span>급행5</span></span></li></ul></section><p class=\"km-traffic-note\">주변 교통 정보는 제공된 카카오맵 약도 기준입니다. 노선과 정차 여부는 운행 상황에 따라 달라질 수 있습니다.</p></div></section>"}